flowchart TB
  UI[Existing views and intentional App action owner]
  QUERY[Focused query/refresh ownership]
  TAURI[Tauri command and event adapter]
  COORD[Scan coordinator: lifecycle, cancellation, progress]
  INVENTORY[Course inventory and bounded traversal]
  subgraph COLLECT[Deep collection modules]
    ANN[Announcement collection: request + parse + interpret]
    MAT[Material collection: request + parse + expand + enrich]
  end
  REQUEST[Existing authenticated HTTP adapter and read interpretation]
  OBS[Resource observations + explicit collection coverage]
  RECON[Deep resource reconciliation: writes + diff + baseline + misses + dedup]
  DB[Existing SQLite connection and persistence]
  COMMIT[Committed scan result]
  DELIVERY[Existing notification and mirror workers]
  UI --> QUERY --> TAURI --> COORD
  COORD --> INVENTORY
  INVENTORY --> COLLECT
  COLLECT --> REQUEST
  REQUEST <-->|Allowlisted reads| QUANTA[Quanta Moodle]
  COLLECT --> OBS --> RECON --> DB
  DB --> COMMIT --> DELIVERY
  COMMIT --> TAURI
  FIXTURE[Loopback HTTP fixtures] -.-> REQUEST
  TMPDB[Temporary SQLite tests] -.-> RECON
  NOTE[Phase A: preserve behavior during extraction.
  Correctness fixes and request-denial semantics are separate changes.]
